WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.604
Your shoppers want to design their ring, and see the price now.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.264
Price on request makes them wait,

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.996
and some don't come back.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.668
Custom Diamond Ring Builder turns your rate sheet into live ring pricing.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.200
Shoppers choose each stone.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.388
The price updates instantly.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.220
Upload one CSV.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.648
Only stones you've priced are offered.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.528
Photos match the carat.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.076
The selector matches your theme.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.208
Every choice lands on the order,

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.524
ready for your workshop.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.752
Custom Diamond Ring Builder.
